ormation about the courses can be found on the Registrar’s Office schedule of classes at https://www.du.edu/registrar/course/scheduleofclasses.html. This posting will serve for multiple openings throughout the 2025-2026 academic year. 498950 Library Information Sciences @Denver Adjunct Faculty Denver, CO July 29, 2026 Open until filled The Morgridge College of Education is looking to hire adjunct instructors for the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of graduate courses in the Master of Library and Information Science online program (MLIS@Denver). 498941 Adjunct Faculty, Office for Public Good Strategy and Research (OPG) Denver, CO July 28, 2026 Open until filled The OPG seeks to hire adjunct instructors for Fall, Winter and Spring quarters of the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of undergraduate and graduate courses across key programs and initiatives, including the Mental Health and Wellness Minor and Collaborative for Mental Health and Wellness. 498929 School Counseling @ Denver Adjunct Faculty Denver, CO July 24, 2026 Open until filled The Morgridge College of Education is looking to hire adjunct instructors for the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of graduate courses in the School Counseling@Denver online program. 498919 Adjunct Faculty, Department of Communication Studies Denver, CO July 21, 2026 Open until filled The Department of Communication Studies seeks applications for adjunct instructors during the 2026-2027 academic year. Adjunct instructors are needed to teach a variety of communication studies courses; Instructors may be hired to teach one course or multiple courses. Classes run in 10-week sessions. Though the University’s administrative offices are open Monday – Friday, 8:00 am – 4:30 pm, faculty schedules vary from term to term and are based on courses taught, service commitments, and research agendas. 498907 Adjunct Faculty - Department of Media, Film and Journalism Studies Denver, CO July 15, 2026 Open until filled Th