ment of Media, Film and Journalism Studies invites applications for adjunct faculty for the 2026-2027 academic year. This posting will serve for multiple openings across the department. 498901 Adjunct Faculty, Indigenous Languages of the West Denver, CO July 13, 2026 Open until filled The CWLC at the University of Denver invites applications for adjunct faculty to teach courses in Indigenous Languages of the West, including, but not limited to, Cheyenne, Arapaho, Lakota, Navajo, or Ute. This is a part-time, non-tenure-track teaching position. 498893 Adjunct Faculty, Kinesiology Program Denver, CO July 01, 2026 Open until filled We are looking for adjunct faculty to design and/or teach course(s) to be taken on campus. We seek to fulfill adjunct faculty to design and/or teach courses in the KINE major and minor. 498869 Adjunct Faculty Master of Arts in International Disaster Psychology: Trauma and Global Mental Health (MAIDP), Graduate School of Professional Psychology Denver, CO June 30, 2026 Open until filled The MAIDP at the Graduate School of Professional Psychology is accepting applications for adjunct faculty instructors to teach a variety of courses in the 2026-2027 academic year. This posting will serve for multiple openings. 498871 Adjunct Faculty  Doctor of Psychology in Clinical Psychology (PsyD) Graduate School of Professional Psychology Denver, CO June 30, 2026 Open until filled The PsyD program at the Graduate School of Professional Psychology is accepting applications for adjunct faculty instructors to teach a variety of courses in the 2026-2027 academic year. This posting will serve for multiple openings. 498870 Adjunct Faculty Master of Arts in Sport Coaching (MASC) & Certificates Graduate School of Professional Psychology Denver, CO June 30, 2026 Open until filled The MASC program and certificates at the Graduate School of Professional Psychology are accepting applications for adjunct faculty instructors to teach a variety of courses in the 2026-2027 academic year. This posting will serve for multiple openings. 498864 Instructors for Course INTZ 2501 Denver, CO June 26, 2026 Open until filled The Office of Internationalization offers three courses connected to study abroad, INTZ 2501, INTZ 2502 and INTZ 2503. This course, INTZ 2501 Exploring Global Citizenship, is offered Fall, Winter and Spring quarters. 498841 Adjunct Faculty, Psychology Department for AY 2026-2027 Denver, CO June 15, 2026 Open until filled The Department of Psychology at the University of Denver is looking to hire adjunct instructors for the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of undergraduate and graduate courses. More Jobs 24 Powered by PageUp The University of Denver Annual Security and Fire Safety Report is available. This report includes statistics from the previous three years concerning reported crime that occurred on campus, in certain off-campus buildings or property owned or controlled by the University of Denver campus and statistics for fires in University housing. The report also includes institutional policies concerning campus security and other safety information along with fire safety policies and procedures. You may obtain a hard copy of this report by contacting the Department of Campus Safety or by accessing the following website: https://www.du.edu/campussafety/clery-act University of Denver is proud to be ranked among the top five Best Employers in Colorado Contact Human Resources & Inclusive Community Connect With Us Facebook\" Twitter\" Jobs@du.edu 303-871-7420 303-871-7420 https://www.du.edu/human-resources Mary Reed Building 2199 S University Blvd Denver, CO 80208 M - F 8am - 4:30pm Maps Jobs Contact Privacy Policy Feedback Cookies Copyright© 2025  University of Denver. | All rights reserved. | The University of Denver is an equal opportunity institution"
