y of Denver's Non‑Discrimination‑Statement . All offers of employment are contingent upon satisfactory completion of a criminal history and National Sex Offender Registry background check. Advertised: July 24, 2026 Applications close: Open until filled Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App Send me jobs like these We will email you new jobs that match this search. Ok, we will send you jobs like this. The email address was invalid, please check for errors. You must agree to the privacy statement Subscribe Recaptcha Privacy agreement Search results Job Number Position Location Date Posted Close Date 498929 School Counseling @ Denver Adjunct Faculty Denver, CO July 24, 2026 Open until filled The Morgridge College of Education is looking to hire adjunct instructors for the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of graduate courses in the School Counseling@Denver online program. Current opportunities Job Number Position Location Date Posted Close Date 498929 School Counseling @ Denver Adjunct Faculty Denver, CO July 24, 2026 Open until filled The Morgridge College of Education is looking to hire adjunct instructors for the 2026-2027 academic year to teach a variety of graduate courses in the School Counseling@Denver online program. Powered by PageUp The University of Denver Annual Security and Fire Safety Report is available. This report includes statistics from the previous three years concerning reported crime that occurred on campus, in certain off-campus buildings or property owned or controlled by the University of Denver campus and statistics for fires in University housing. The report also includes institutional policies concerning campus security and other safety information along with fire safety policies and procedures. You may obtain a hard copy of this report by contacting the Department of Campus Safety or by accessing the following website: https://www.du.edu/campussafety/clery-act University of Denver is pr